{"2960760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greed Forest TD", "steam_appid": 2960760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Forest TD is a tower defense roguelite where the forest is teeming with gold and danger, and you are Buildy, a greedy little machine. <br>Wall off the wildlife with huge mazes of towers, dig up everything that glitters, and collect the gold from every creature that tries to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how much gold does a squirrel carry?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than you'd think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your spells to autocast and casually watch the night unfold, or cast spells by hand and build mid-battle. Most maps take 10-20 minutes, with the option of entering endless mode to push your run to the limit and see how you rank against other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day, Survive by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to build a maze, throw down gold extractors, and upgrade towers with unique attack effects. Start the night, and watch the forest pour in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bleed the Forest Dry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emitter is what draws the forest's creatures, and every sunrise you can crank its signal for bigger threats and bigger bounties. Advance deeper one map at a time, unlocking new spells and powerups as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forest Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On siege maps the forest goes on the offensive: enemies attack your towers, and bosses come hunting for everything you've built. Fight back by combining towers into monstrous stacks, or Spirit Link them to your Buildy and carry their firepower into battle yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We think you'll love Greed Forest if you enjoyed:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warcraft III tower defenses, Element TD, Legion TD, GemCraft, Rogue Tower, Emberward, Isle of Arrows, Bloons TD 6, Kingdom Rush, Thronefall, They Are Billions, Megabonk, and Vampire Survivors</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed Forest TD is a tower defense roguelite where the forest is teeming with gold and danger, and you are Buildy, a greedy little machine. <br>Wall off the wildlife with huge mazes of towers, dig up everything that glitters, and collect the gold from every creature that tries to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how much gold does a squirrel carry?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than you'd think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your spells to autocast and casually watch the night unfold, or cast spells by hand and build mid-battle. Most maps take 10-20 minutes, with the option of entering endless mode to push your run to the limit and see how you rank against other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day, Survive by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to build a maze, throw down gold extractors, and upgrade towers with unique attack effects. Start the night, and watch the forest pour in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/d64b16afdbf70eddca4f189b661a280a.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bleed the Forest Dry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emitter is what draws the forest's creatures, and every sunrise you can crank its signal for bigger threats and bigger bounties. Advance deeper one map at a time, unlocking new spells and powerups as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/b2068e461c8a6ae10010877ab7bf9d07.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forest Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On siege maps the forest goes on the offensive: enemies attack your towers, and bosses come hunting for everything you've built. Fight back by combining towers into monstrous stacks, or Spirit Link them to your Buildy and carry their firepower into battle yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.poster.avif?t=1787744296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.webm?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/413f02254cb904b5fd309cf8c5da9a71.mp4?t=1787744296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We think you'll love Greed Forest if you enjoyed:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warcraft III tower defenses, Element TD, Legion TD, GemCraft, Rogue Tower, Emberward, Isle of Arrows, Bloons TD 6, Kingdom Rush, Thronefall, They Are Billions, Megabonk, and Vampire Survivors</p>", "short_description": 